==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
Due to the minimal changes to the original enemies, you can use a similar rush strategy to the normal version of this stage, as the Li'l Zyclones can be dealt with with crowd-controllers such as [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Weedwacker Cat]] and [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Polevaulter/Housewife Cat]], allowing you to easily deal with the rest of the stage.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
An easy enough stage to rush with a tanky barrier breaker like [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|The Kitty of Liberty]] to get to [[Le'Solar]], when paired with a basic zombie killer in [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Wushu Cat]] to clear out the weak peons from causing further issues.

[[Cadaver Bear]] shouldn't be an issue unless you are behind on your gacha true forms, and heavily underleveled.

